## Quickstart

```bash
make setup     # virtual environment and dependencies (uses uv when installed)
make demo      # data -> models -> evaluation -> validation -> simulation -> reports -> API smoke test
make api       # then, in a second terminal: make app   (optionally: make replay)
```

`make test` runs the test suite on the tiny profile; `make full` repeats the pipeline at full scale. Measured stage times for this run: {% for k, v in timings.items() %}{{ k }} {{ v | fmt(0) }} s{{ "; " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}. They were taken on an 8 GB Apple M2 under heavy memory pressure from other applications; see `docs/project_plan.md` for the budget discussion.

